  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Cheng is named the male lead in Su Xian’s night elopement, and Su Xian Er is named as his wife. Over two hundred years earlier she is a concubine’s daughter in Su tribe who pours wine for him, then rides out at night as a rank one Gu Master to save him after Su tribe poisons and hunts him. He swears she will be his only wife. The pair later become Gu Immortals, and the night elopement spreads across Northern Plains as a story that urges women to chase love. Hei Bai also names Hei Lou Lan as Su Xian Er’s child, and says she fell seriously ill giving birth, then died in an earthly calamity years later.",
      "chapters": [
        528
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_hei_bai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later talk still treats that night elopement story as something that pierced deep into people’s hearts.",
      "chapters": [
        529
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a jade-like beauty with slender and fair hands.",
      "chapters": [
        528
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness takes charge of Su tribe, renames her third sister Su Xian Er, and sends her to approach Hei Cheng for Hei Fan’s time path inheritance. Hei Cheng and Su Xian Er fall in love as a Gu Immortal couple, and Su Xian’s Night Elopement becomes a famous story. She stays for love after her traces are exposed. Hei Cheng then secretly kills her to prolong his own life.",
      "chapters": [
        946
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribe-years",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "char_hei_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Self strength Immortal Gu is later named a memento she refined and left to Hei Lou Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        974
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
